# Privacy Policy

This application does not collect, store, or share any personal data.

The Business Card App provides:
- Viewing of static personal information (name, email, job title)
- Contact form that opens the device email client
- Local storage of CV items using Android DataStore (on the user's device only)

No data is transmitted to external servers.

The app does not use:
- Camera
- Microphone
- Location
- Network data collection

All information entered by the user remains on the device and is removed when the app is deleted.
